# SO CLOSE BUT SO FAR
@Juan | 🇪🇸  | 91 , the reigning World  Champion, sacked by @Carti Racing Association [🇮🇹]  and shortly after signed by @Richard Mille LM Motorsport F1 [🇩🇪] , who were at the time, trailing the scarlet red of @Scuderia Ferrari [🇮🇹]  by 4 points in the F1 standings with just 2 rounds to go.
@Juan | 🇪🇸  | 91  went on to become a F2 WDC contender, but wasnt able to make the trophy his. After the conclusion of the most previous edition F2 season, @Juan | 🇪🇸  | 91 went on to make his debut in the first round of F1, quitting before round 2 ever came round.

# FAMILY REUNION
After being signed by @Richard Mille LM Motorsport F1 [🇩🇪]  @Juan | 🇪🇸  | 91  replaced @Peters | 🇨🇱 | 19 , who was then signed by his roots in VMS, @Tarigy’s Motorsport Team F1 [🇪🇸] . The same very team he raced for in F3.

